msgstr "በራሱ ጽሁፍ መፍጠር አልተቻለም:"

#: dochdl.src#MSG_CLPBRD_FORMAT_ERROR.infobox.text
#: dochdl.src%23MSG_CLPBRD_FORMAT_ERROR.infobox.text
msgid "Requested clipboard format is not available."
msgstr "የተጠየቀው የ ቁራጭ ሰሌዳ አቀራረብ አልተገኘም:"

#: dochdl.src#MSG_UPDATE_NEW_GLOS_FMT.querybox.text
#: dochdl.src%23MSG_UPDATE_NEW_GLOS_FMT.querybox.text
msgid ""
"The section format is outdated.\n"
"It needs to be converted so that changes\n"
"can be saved.\n"
"Should it be converted now?"
msgstr ""
"የዚህ ክፍል አቀራረብ ጊዜው ያለፈበት ነው:\n"
"መቀየር አለበት ከዚያም ለውጦቹን\n"
"ማስቀመጥ ይችላሉ:\n"
"አሁን ልቀይረው?"

